    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucas lives in a ranch with his grandpa, Mr. Lon, unaware that Supremetoid, a terrible space villain, is preparing an assault along his hordes of alien soldiers. His goal: destroy all the chickens his ship's radar can find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/4b748e4bfe330e29c8105bc6328a408f.avif?t=1745517177\" width=630 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they least expect it, the villain fires a beam that opens portals on Mr. Lon\u2019s ranch and the neighboring farms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/9b57bb5dbbeddf51667f0a1c31530828.avif?t=1745517177\" width=630 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chupacabras, Barataliens, Vespaliens, Ogralines, and other abominable enemies spread across the ranches, causing chaos and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/3570985eb2d476142e1d0cb97ed0b8ac.avif?t=1745517177\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/556ac511aa2aa148d175f10127e1633b.avif?t=1745517177\" width=630 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it\u2019s up to Lucas to mount a defense against the alien hordes to save the chickens from being destroyed by the <strong>Chicken Coop Invaders</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/5bd0b603fdaf77c5f139cd77786bf807.avif?t=1745517177\" width=630 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense FPS action mechanics with Tower Defense elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 different invasion levels (plus one ultra-secret stage to unlock)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >410 chickens to save!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucas lives in a ranch with his grandpa, Mr. Lon, unaware that Supremetoid, a terrible space villain, is preparing an assault along his hordes of alien soldiers. His goal: destroy all the chickens his ship's radar can find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/4b748e4bfe330e29c8105bc6328a408f.avif?t=1745517177\" width=630 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they least expect it, the villain fires a beam that opens portals on Mr. Lon\u2019s ranch and the neighboring farms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/9b57bb5dbbeddf51667f0a1c31530828.avif?t=1745517177\" width=630 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chupacabras, Barataliens, Vespaliens, Ogralines, and other abominable enemies spread across the ranches, causing chaos and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/3570985eb2d476142e1d0cb97ed0b8ac.avif?t=1745517177\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/556ac511aa2aa148d175f10127e1633b.avif?t=1745517177\" width=630 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it\u2019s up to Lucas to mount a defense against the alien hordes to save the chickens from being destroyed by the <strong>Chicken Coop Invaders</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682920/extras/5bd0b603fdaf77c5f139cd77786bf807.avif?t=1745517177\" width=630 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense FPS action mechanics with Tower Defense elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40 different invasion levels (plus one ultra-secret stage to unlock)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >410 chickens to save!</p></li></ul>",
